"source":"BTS 32 · #38","image":"/img/scene-clips/7163.webp","imageBytes":26922,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7163.mp4","videoBytes":129449,"duration":4.041667},"eaf3eb5f6449":{"text":"Do you meditate or do yoga?","id":"eaf3eb5f6449","source":"BTS 32 · #61","image":"/img/scene-clips/7325.webp","imageBytes":14970,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7325.mp4","videoBytes":93696,"duration":4.041667},"7d44da44361e":{"text":"Is music a good stress reliever?","id":"7d44da44361e","source":"BTS 32 · #86","image":"/img/scene-clips/7414.webp","imageBytes":19156,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7414.mp4","videoBytes":119236,"duration":4.041667},"36c7186a261f":{"text":"Do bad habits affect your health?","id":"36c7186a261f","source":"BTS 32 · #25","image":"/img/scene-clips/7426.webp","imageBytes":17822,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7426.mp4","videoBytes":126633,"duration":4.041667},"0ba1ea86b1a1":{"text":"How does stress affect your grades?","id":"0ba1ea86b1a1","source":"BTS 32 · #58","image":"/img/scene-clips/7478.webp","imageBytes":18246,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7478.mp4","videoBytes":103100,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["Do you know people with bad habits?","What differences do you notice between people?","Do bad habits affect your health?","Try to think positively about your situation.","How can you break a bad habit?","Biting your nails is a common bad habit.","Everyone has their own strengths and weaknesses.","Everyone looks a little bit different.","Each day, every person faces many different situations.","Physical characteristics are how you look on the outside.","What makes you unique and special?","Don't worry. Everything will be okay.","It's okay to be different from others.","On what holidays does your school close?","Is it important to acknowledge your stress?","Why does everyone think those are important days?","Which holiday is your favorite? Why?","Are there any holidays you don't like?","Some situations we can control, while others we can't.","Talking to a friend can help you feel better.","Do you support your friends when they're stressed?","I like to listen to music when I'm stressed.","Is music a good stress reliever?","Exercise is a great way to reduce stress.","How does stress affect your grades?","It's important to take breaks when studying.","What bad habits do you want to change?","How long does it take to break a habit?","Have you ever felt different from your classmates?","Have you ever successfully quit a bad habit?","What helped you stop that habit?","Is it harder to break bad habits alone or with help?","What's the most common bad habit among teenagers?","How can parents help their children break bad habits?","Do you think awareness is the first step to changing?","Have you ever tried to help someone break a bad habit?","Have you ever judged someone based on their appearance?","Do differences make the world more interesting?","Is being different a good thing or a bad thing?","Do you accept people who are different?","Do you regret it now?","Should we celebrate our differences?","Are there any holidays specific to your culture?","Do you spend holidays with your family?","Are holidays important for maintaining family bonds?","What's the longest holiday break you have at school?","How do you spend your time during long holidays?","Do you prefer staying home or traveling during holidays?","Have you traveled to another country for a holiday?","What was that experience like?","Do different countries celebrate the same holidays?","Are some holidays more fun than others?","How do you feel when a holiday is coming up?","Do you look forward to school holidays?","What stress management techniques do you use?","Does stress affect your sleep?","Do you know how to relax?","What activities help you feel calm?","Meditation can help you feel calm and relaxed.","Do you meditate or do yoga?","Have you ever tried deep breathing exercises?","Does spending time in nature reduce your stress?","Do you talk to someone when you're stressed?","Who do you usually talk to when stressed?","Can too much stress make you sick?","Have you ever felt overwhelmed by stress?","How did you handle it?","Do you think teenagers are more stressed than adults?","What causes the most stress in your life?","Is school the main source of stress for you?","How can schools help reduce student stress?","Do you think your school does a good job managing stress?","What would you suggest to reduce school stress?","Do you have any stress-relief hobbies?","How often do you do things to relax?","Is it normal to feel stressed sometimes?","Do bad habits often develop from stress?","How much exercise do you do per week?","Do you feel better after exercising?","What kind of music helps you relax?","Have you ever used music to manage stress?","How many hours of sleep do you get each night?","Does lack of sleep increase stress?","What physical symptoms does stress cause?","Eating too much junk food is unhealthy."]}
